<title>PHILIPPINES: Uniwide Q1 net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Uniwide Q1 net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)    0.08 vs 0.02</p>
<p>    Operating income		379.38 vs 109.57</p>
<p>    Net income			203.82 vs 31.49</p>
<p>Note: Full name Uniwide Holdings Inc. The firm has interests in retailing and is now branching out into real estate. The figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
